Source: "main.s"
                            	     1: ; STE Spectrum 4096 sprite experiment. vasm Motorola syntax, 68000 only.
                            	     2: ; Moving masked ball. SPACE pauses/resumes; Q toggles palette rebuilding;
                            	     3: ; ESC restores the desktop. Default fast mode uses the background palette.
                            	     4: ; draw_begin accepts ball_x=0..288 and ball_y=1..168 (row zero is SPU sync).
